* Further competitive continuations (tables)

Phase 4 (NOTES.md #P7). Generated once from the most frequent positions where a
coverage replay still left the system after `competitive-later.bml`: the
advancer after our overcall in the sandwich position or over their 1NT
response, opener after a competitive response and the opponents' next call,
opener after responder's raise or negative double of an overcall, opener after
a two-over-one response and an overcall, the advancer after the opponents
raise or bid over our two-level overcall, the overcaller after advancer's new
suit, the weak-two opener's partner after the second round, and the
partnership after its natural calls over their 1NT. The calls are natural: a
raise with the stated support at the cheapest level, a rebid of a six-card
suit, a notrump only with a stopper; otherwise the partnership passes from
then on. A table is written only where the auction leading to it is on the
system and no table exists yet.

